--- !u!114 &4466198
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 4466197}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ea45832cf80cb949b54bcc01f3dc5e0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.ImpLineBeat
  _note: 
  _lines:
  - And that is the money game. Funny thing, cash. People are certain it hides who
    they are. It is the exact opposite. It is the clearest little window I have got.
  - I know what you clung to. I know what you could not bear to give away, and what
    you let go far too easily. It all goes in the book.
  - Rest now, or do not. I am always here. And I am always, always adding it up.
  _clickLockout: 0.25
  _clearAtEnd: 0
