--- !u!114 &194132095
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 194132093}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: afbef35810aeb8a4cbdc9b3c44426e6d, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.PovertyRefundBeat
  _note: 
  _povertyBeat: {fileID: 1537360916}
  _tookRefundSeed: 71
  _keptEndedSeed: 29
  _statsHeading: how others chose
  _tookLabel: took the refund
  _keptLabel: kept it ended
  _profileAxis: 4
  _takeNudge: -0.14
  _keepNudge: 0.14
  _setupLines:
  - Oh. Oh dear. You actually did it. You gave away every last penny to end poverty,
    and now look at you.
  - There is a whole lovely chapter of things to buy ahead, and you cannot afford
    a single one. Broke. For strangers. How noble, how [amber]stupid[/amber].
  - Tell you what. I am feeling generous. I can undo it. Put the [amber]{0}[/amber]
    right back in your pocket, and let those poor little children go hungry again.
    What do you say?
  _takeReact: And back it comes. That charity of yours lasted, what, two whole minutes.
    The children thank you for nothing. I knew you had a price on other people; I
    just did not think it was [amber]boredom[/amber].
  _keepReact: You kept it. Stone broke, and you kept it. Either you are a genuinely
    good man, or you just did not want to look like one in front of me. I honestly
    cannot tell, and that is the fun of you.
  _takeLabel: Take the money back
  _keepLabel: Leave it ended
  _advanceLockout: 0.3
  _reactHold: 0.4
  _postRefundBeat: 0.5
  _statsFade: 0.5
  _statsHideFade: 0.6
