  _pitch: One more year. Added to the life you already finished. Healthy, awake,
    yours. Pretend for a moment you were not dead. What is a year worth to you? [amber]{0}[/amber],
    as it turns out. Buy it, or keep your money.
  _brandKey: 
  _buyReact: Bought a year. Everyone has a number for that one, and now I have yours.
    [amber]{0}[/amber] for twelve more months. Filed away.
  _passReact: You would not buy a single extra year. Either you are at peace, or
    you are cheap about the one thing every living soul wants more of. I have my
    guess.
  _brokeReact: With what, exactly? You have nothing. You gave it all away. You get
    to just watch this one.
  _bulkTierLine: 
  _bulkStopReact: '[amber]{0}[/amber] years of some stranger, poured into you. You
    will not feel a single one of them. Marvellous.'
  _bulkZeroReact: Not one year. Too squeamish, or too cheap. Either reads the same
    from here.
