  _pitch: Small one. Your nose. It is a bad nose, we both know it. For [amber]{0}[/amber]
    I will make it slightly less bad. Not good. Just less bad. Buy it?
  _brandKey: 
  _buyReact: Two whole dollars, on a marginally less awful nose, for a face nobody
    will ever see again. I adore that you did that.
  _passReact: You would not spend even two dollars to fix that nose. Attached to
    it, are you. That is almost sweet.
  _brokeReact: With what, exactly? You have nothing. You gave it all away. You get
    to just watch this one.
  _bulkTierLine: 
  _bulkStopReact: '[amber]{0}[/amber] years of some stranger, poured into you. You
    will not feel a single one of them. Marvellous.'
  _bulkZeroReact: Not one year. Too squeamish, or too cheap. Either reads the same
    from here.
  _buyLabel: Buy it
  _passLabel: Keep the money
