  _pitch: Last temptation before we cash out. The truth about how you actually [red]died[/red].
    Not the tidy story you tell yourself. The real one. It is not quite what you
    think. [amber]{0}[/amber]. Want it?
  _brandKey: 
  _buyReact: Bought the truth, and I am going to keep it anyway, because watching
    you wonder is worth far more to me than [amber]{0}[/amber]. It was the drink.
    Mostly. Probably. There. Spend your money on that.
  _passReact: You would rather not know. A man who spent his whole life deciding
    what was true, and here at the end he waves off the one verdict that is actually
    his own. Telling. The drink, by the way. Probably.
  _brokeReact: With what, exactly? You have nothing. You gave it all away. You get
    to just watch this one.
  _bulkTierLine: 
  _bulkStopReact: '[amber]{0}[/amber] years of some stranger, poured into you. You
    will not feel a single one of them. Marvellous.'
  _bulkZeroReact: Not one year. Too squeamish, or too cheap. Either reads the same
    from here.
  _buyLabel: Buy it
  _passLabel: Keep the money
  _bulkBuyLabel: Buy one
  _bulkStopLabel: Enough
