  _keptLabel: kept it for nothing
  _profileAxis: 4
  _hoardNudgeScale: 0.2
  _menuPitch: Last stop. You have [amber]{0}[/amber] left, and it is no use to a
    dead man. So. One last thing, on me. Whatever it stretches to. Pick something,
    or do not.
  _brokePitch: Last stop. You have [amber]{0}[/amber]. Which buys precisely nothing.
    Not even the sweet. There is nothing to offer you, so let us just look at what
    you did.
  _pickReact: '{0}. Out of everything, that was the thing. Of course it was. It says
    more than you know.'
  _refuseReact: Nothing. You would rather keep a number you cannot spend than let
    me buy you one small kindness. Clutching an empty wallet all the way out. Perfect.
  _readBlew: You spent nearly all of it, and fast. A man who cannot hold onto a thing,
    money, a marriage, a lane in the road. I did watch you empty yourself out here,
    and I think we both learned what you reach for.
  _readHoard: You kept nearly all of it. Dead, in a void, no pockets, no tomorrow,
    and still you would not let a single dollar go. That is not thrift. That is a
    man who counts. You always were counting, up there on the bench.
  _readMiddle: Some spent, some kept. You weighed every one of these, did you not.
    Never all in, never all out. I have a very clear picture of you now, clearer
    than you would like.
  _refuseLabel: Keep the money
  _advanceLockout: 0.3
  _reactHold: 0.4
  _readHold: 0.5
  _statsFade: 0.5
  _statsHideFade: 0.6
