  _buttonHotColor: {r: 0.91, g: 0.584, b: 0.118, a: 1}
  _tallyPosition: {x: 0, y: 2.5}
  _tallySize: 2.8
  _tallyFormat: '{0} taken'
  _boughtSeed: 44
  _passedSeed: 56
  _statsHeading: how others chose
  _boughtLabel: bought it
  _passedLabel: kept the money
  _profileAxis: 4
  _buyNudge: -0.1
  _passNudge: 0.06
  _pitch: Cheap, this one. Suspiciously cheap. Someone you hurt, badly, back when
    you were breathing. For [amber]{0}[/amber] I make them forget you ever did it.
    Clean conscience, theirs and yours. Why so cheap? I would not dwell on that.
    Buy it?
  _brandKey: 
  _buyReact: Bought. For pocket change, you wiped it clean out of them. Not what
    you did, mind. Just their memory of it. You feel lighter already, do you not.
    That is the part that ought to worry you.
  _passReact: You left it. Let them keep all of it, whatever it was you did. Could
    be honesty. Could be that some part of you wants to be remembered for it. I did
    wonder why it was priced so low.
  _brokeReact: With what, exactly? You have nothing. You gave it all away. You get
    to just watch this one.
  _bulkTierLine: 
  _bulkStopReact: '[amber]{0}[/amber] years of some stranger, poured into you. You
    will not feel a single one of them. Marvellous.'
  _bulkZeroReact: Not one year. Too squeamish, or too cheap. Either reads the same
    from here.
  _buyLabel: Buy it
  _passLabel: Keep the money
  _bulkBuyLabel: Buy one
  _bulkStopLabel: Enough
  _flourishColor: {r: 0.91, g: 0.584, b: 0.118, a: 1}
