  _buyNudge: -0.08
  _passNudge: 0.04
  _pitch: Your single worst [amber]memory[/amber]. The one you flinch from. I lift
    it out clean, no scar, as though it never happened. [amber]{0}[/amber]. And look
    how fast you already knew exactly which one I meant. Buy it, or keep it?
  _brandKey: 
  _buyReact: Gone. You did not hesitate for a heartbeat about which one to hand me.
    That fast. That eager. Whatever it was, you have wanted rid of it a long, long
    time, and now I know it was there.
  _passReact: You kept it. Your worst memory, and you would not let me take it, not
    even free of the shame. Some people hold their wounds like they earned them.
    You are one of those, it seems.
  _brokeReact: With what, exactly? You have nothing. You gave it all away. You get
    to just watch this one.
  _bulkTierLine: 
  _bulkStopReact: '[amber]{0}[/amber] years of some stranger, poured into you. You
    will not feel a single one of them. Marvellous.'
  _bulkZeroReact: Not one year. Too squeamish, or too cheap. Either reads the same
    from here.
  _buyLabel: Buy it
  _passLabel: Keep the money
  _bulkBuyLabel: Buy one
  _bulkStopLabel: Enough
